{"ref":"BDB, אָסָא","hw":"אָסָא","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָסָא</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>perhaps <em>healer</em><strong>)</strong> I king of Judah, son of Abijam and father of Jehoshaphat <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.8\">1 K 15:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.11\">11</a> + 24 times <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15\" href=\"/I_Kings.15\">1 K 15</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16\" href=\"/I_Kings.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22\" href=\"/I_Kings.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.10\">1 Ch 3:10</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 13:23\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.13.23\">2 Ch 13:23</a> + 28 times <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14-21\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14-21\">2 Ch 14–21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.9\">Je 41:9</a>. Perhaps apoc. theophoric name, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, רְפָאֵל\" href=\"/BDB,_רְפָאֵל\", dir=\"rtl\">רְפָאֵל</a>. Also son of Elkanah and father of Berechiah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.16\">1 Ch 9:16</a>.","next":"BDB, אסה²","prev":"BDB, אסה"}